flowchart LR
    classDef data fill:#C5E1A5,stroke:#333,color:#000
    classDef train fill:#FFCC80,stroke:#333,color:#000
    classDef reg fill:#B39DDB,stroke:#333,color:#000
    classDef serve fill:#80DEEA,stroke:#333,color:#000
    classDef app fill:#C8E6C9,stroke:#333,color:#000
    classDef orch fill:#E1BEE7,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:#000

    GOLD[Gold Tables]:::data --> EXTRACT["Training Extract<br/>as_of pinned"]:::app

    EXTRACT --> DISPATCH{Compute}:::app
    DISPATCH --> TRUN["training_run<br/>dynamic Dagster asset"]:::orch
    TRUN -->|CPU| CR_JOB[Cloud Run Job]:::train
    TRUN -->|GPU| VTX[Vertex AI Training]:::train

    CR_JOB --> MLFLOW["MLflow<br/>Track and Register"]:::reg
    VTX --> MLFLOW

    MLFLOW --> VALIDATE["Asset Checks<br/>walk-forward, PBO, DSR<br/>Dagster asset checks"]:::orch
    VALIDATE -->|pass| PROMOTE["Promote<br/>event to PGMQ"]:::app

    PROMOTE --> MV["model_version<br/>Dagster asset"]:::orch

    MV --> SRV_IN[Sync Inference]:::serve
    MV --> SRV_BATCH[Batch Inference]:::serve
    MV --> SRV_GPU[Dedicated GPU Serving]:::serve

    SRV_IN --> LOG[(inference_log)]:::data
    SRV_BATCH --> LOG
    SRV_GPU --> LOG
